WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.336
The camera can be keyframed like any knob.

2
00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:07.480
Its position and rotation live in Virtual Camera, under Transform.

3
00:00:07.938 --> 00:00:10.787
Orbit the view, and the six numbers follow.

4
00:00:10.787 --> 00:00:13.835
Position X, Y and Z, and rotation, in degrees.

5
00:00:14.286 --> 00:00:17.815
Make a timeline with the plus button, and put the playhead on bar one.

6
00:00:18.274 --> 00:00:19.330
Press Key camera.

7
00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.685
All six values are keyed at the playhead, in one step.

8
00:00:23.142 --> 00:00:25.471
Move to bar five, and orbit somewhere new.

9
00:00:25.471 --> 00:00:28.578
Now that the camera has keyframes, a drag only previews.

10
00:00:28.578 --> 00:00:31.129
Nothing is written yet, and the panel says so.

11
00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:34.880
Press Key camera again to keep this view as the second key.

12
00:00:35.337 --> 00:00:37.932
Press Stop to go back to the start, then Play.

13
00:00:37.932 --> 00:00:42.278
The camera travels from the first key to the second, then the timeline loops.

14
00:00:42.278 --> 00:00:44.253
Rotation takes the short way round.

15
00:00:49.477 --> 00:00:55.005
Type a value to place the camera exactly, or patch an L F O into any of the six.

16
00:00:55.005 --> 00:00:58.114
There is no scale: field of view is the zoom.
